  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Marine Turtle Conservation Efforts along the Kenyan Coast</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The recipient will carry out a sea turtle bycatch release program with up to 350 local artisanal fishers; conduct anti-poaching patrols along 20 km of nesting beach within and north and south of Watamu Marine National Park; conduct outreach and awareness sessions with local communities; and conduct training workshops for up to 30 Kenya Wildlife Service staff on marine ecology, coastal zone management and conservation principles.</narrative>
  </description>
